The *.txt prompt templates in this directory are adapted from graphiti-core 0.30.1
(graphiti_core/prompts: extract_nodes.extract_text, extract_nodes.extract_summaries_batch,
dedupe_nodes.nodes, extract_edges.edge, dedupe_edges.resolve_edge) and modified by Loupist.
`{{name}}` marks where `world_extract::prompts` inserts the per-call context.

Files Loupist changed (Apache License, Version 2.0, section 4(b)):

- extract_text.user.txt: the excluded-word lists, the guidelines' examples and the two
  examples use company and filing cases and Loupist's entity types; a guideline for a
  continued table.
- dedupe_nodes.user.txt: the line on an existing entity's spellings and codes; company examples.
- extract_edges.system.txt: when a fact is given a time.
- extract_edges.user.txt: a value about one subject uses that subject in both roles; facts
  are those the message states; the date rules (a time only when stated or resolvable
  against REFERENCE_TIME, at the precision given, a numeric date of uncertain day and month
  order at year precision) and the reference basis; company examples.
- resolve_edge.user.txt: same_assertion_facts; six examples in place of three.
- extract_summaries_batch.user.txt: the example summary.

Unchanged from graphiti-core: extract_text.system.txt, dedupe_nodes.system.txt,
resolve_edge.system.txt, extract_summaries_batch.system.txt.

